Niobium — iOS local DeepSeek Harness build
==========================================

This distribution includes and statically links the following components:

- iSH / iSH-ARM64 — GPLv3 with the additional iOS terms in
  `ios/ThirdParty/dsh-ios/ish-arm64/LICENSE.IOS`.
- DSH iOS host code — Copyright the DSH contributors, GPLv3, from
  https://github.com/everettjf/dsh-ios.
- Alpine Linux userland and packages — various free software licenses, shipped
  inside the generated guest image `root.tar.gz`.
- DeepSeek Harness (`@deepseek-ai/dsh`) and npm dependencies — MIT and other
  licenses, shipped inside the generated guest image.
- hterm and libapps — BSD-3-Clause.
- libarchive — BSD-2-Clause.

Because the app links iSH, the combined iOS application is distributed under the
GNU General Public License version 3. The source for the complete corresponding
application is this repository, including the `ios/ThirdParty/dsh-ios`
submodule. The guest image is reproducibly built by
`ios/scripts/build-local-dsh.sh`; the exact DSH submodule revision is recorded
by git.

The Android application does not link iSH and remains MIT-licensed; see
`android/` and the root license history.
